 useEffect(()=>{if(!authUser?.uid){setApplication(null);setProducts([]);return;}const q=query(collection(db,'agrovetApplications'),where('ownerUid','==',authUser.uid));const u=onSnapshot(q,s=>{const a=s.docs.map(d=>({id:d.id,...d.data()}))[0]||null;setApplication(a);if(a)setForm(x=>({...blank,...a}));},e=>setMessage('Application could not load: '+e.message));const p=query(collection(db,'marketplaceProducts'),where('ownerUid','==',authUser.uid));const up=onSnapshot(p,s=>setProducts(s.docs.map(d=>({id:d.id,...d.data()}))),e=>setMessage('Your products could not load: '+e.message));return()=>{u();up()}},[authUser?.uid]);
 const submit=async()=>{const user=auth.currentUser||authUser;if(!user?.uid)return setMessage('Please wait for your secure sign-in.');if(!form.shopName||!form.contactName||!form.phone||!form.email||!form.county)return setMessage('Shop name, contact person, phone, email and county are required.');setBusy(true);try{if(application)await updateDoc(doc(db,'agrovetApplications',application.id),{...form,ownerUid:user.uid,updatedAt:serverTimestamp()});else await addDoc(collection(db,'agrovetApplications'),{...form,ownerUid:user.uid,status:'pending',createdAt:serverTimestamp()});setMessage('Shop application submitted for administrator review.');}catch(e){setMessage('Application could not be saved: '+e.message)}finally{setBusy(false)}};
 const addProduct=async()=>{const user=auth.currentUser||authUser;if(!user?.uid)return setMessage('Sign in to continue.');if(!application||application.status!=='approved')return setMessage('Your shop must be approved before you can list products.');if(!product.name||!product.category)return setMessage('Enter a product name and category.');setBusy(true);try{await addDoc(collection(db,'marketplaceProducts'),{...product,price:product.price===''?null:Number(product.price),shop:application.shopName,phone:application.phone,shopAddress:application.address||application.county,shopLat:application.shopLat===''?null:Number(application.shopLat),shopLng:application.shopLng===''?null:Number(application.shopLng),ownerUid:user.uid,available:false,status:'pending',createdAt:serverTimestamp()});setProduct({name:'',category:'Animal feeds',price:'',unit:'',description:'',imageUrl:''});setMessage('Product submitted. It will appear in the Marketplace after admin approval.')}catch(e){setMessage('Product could not be saved: '+e.message)}finally{setBusy(false)}};
 const uploadProductImage=async file=>{if(!file)return;if(!file.type?.startsWith('image/'))return setMessage('Choose a valid image file.');if(file.size>8*1024*1024)return setMessage('Image is too large. Please choose an image under 8 MB.');setImageBusy(true);setMessage('Uploading product image to Cloudinary...');try{const data=new FormData();data.append('file',file);data.append('upload_preset','shambavet');data.append('folder','shambavet/products');const response=await fetch('https://api.cloudinary.com/v1_1/aexsxkgi/image/upload',{method:'POST',body:data});const result=await response.json();if(!response.ok)throw new Error(result?.error?.message||'Cloudinary upload failed. Check that the shambavet preset is unsigned.');setProduct(p=>({...p,imageUrl:result.secure_url}));setMessage('Product image uploaded successfully.');}catch(e){console.error('Cloudinary product image upload failed:',e);setMessage('Image upload failed: '+e.message);}finally{setImageBusy(false)}};
 const remove=async p=>{if(!confirm('Remove this product listing?'))return;try{await deleteDoc(doc(db,'marketplaceProducts',p.id));setMessage('Product listing removed.')}catch(e){setMessage('Could not remove product: '+e.message)}};
 const secureAccount=async()=>{if(!loginEmail||loginPassword.length<6)return setMessage('Enter your email and a password of at least 6 characters.');setBusy(true);try{if(auth.currentUser?.isAnonymous){await linkWithCredential(auth.currentUser,EmailAuthProvider.credential(loginEmail,loginPassword));setMessage('Permanent agrovet account created. Your shop application remains linked.')}else{await signInWithEmailAndPassword(auth,loginEmail,loginPassword);setMessage('Signed in. Your shop dashboard is loading.')}}catch(e){setMessage('Account access failed: '+(e.code==='auth/email-already-in-use'?'This email already has an account. Sign out of the temporary account and sign in with the existing account.':e.message))}finally{setBusy(false)}};
 if(!authUser)return <><Title I={Building2} title="Agrovet shop portal" text="Create or sign in to an account to register your agricultural input shop."/><div className="card"><input type="email" placeholder="Business email" value={loginEmail} onChange={e=>setLoginEmail(e.target.value)}/><input type="password" placeholder="Password (at least 6 characters)" value={loginPassword} onChange={e=>setLoginPassword(e.target.value)}/><button className="primary" onClick={secureAccount} disabled={busy}>{busy?'Please wait...':'Create account / Sign in'}</button><p className="note">If this browser has an anonymous session, creating a permanent account links it so its existing records remain attached.</p>{message&&<p className="hubMessage">{message}</p>}</div></>;
 return <><Title I={Building2} title="Agrovet shop portal" text="Register your shop, wait for verification, then submit products for the ShambaVet Marketplace."/>{authUser?.isAnonymous&&<div className="card"><h3>Protect your shop account</h3><p>Create a permanent email and password so you can manage your listings on another device.</p><div className="formGrid"><input type="email" placeholder="Business email" value={loginEmail} onChange={e=>setLoginEmail(e.target.value)}/><input type="password" placeholder="Password (at least 6 characters)" value={loginPassword} onChange={e=>setLoginPassword(e.target.value)}/></div><button onClick={secureAccount} disabled={busy}>Create permanent agrovet account</button></div>}<div className="card"><h2>Shop registration and verification</h2><div className="formGrid"><input placeholder="Shop / business name *" value={form.shopName} onChange={e=>setForm({...form,shopName:e.target.value})}/><input placeholder="Owner / contact person *" value={form.contactName} onChange={e=>setForm({...form,contactName:e.target.value})}/><input placeholder="Phone number *" value={form.phone} onChange={e=>setForm({...form,phone:e.target.value})}/><input placeholder="Business email *" value={form.email} onChange={e=>setForm({...form,email:e.target.value})}/><input placeholder="Business registration number (optional)" value={form.registrationNumber} onChange={e=>setForm({...form,registrationNumber:e.target.value})}/><CountySelect value={form.county} onChange={v=>setForm({...form,county:v})}/><input placeholder="Shop address / town" value={form.address} onChange={e=>setForm({...form,address:e.target.value})}/><input placeholder="Shop latitude (optional)" value={form.shopLat} onChange={e=>setForm({...form,shopLat:e.target.value})}/><input placeholder="Shop longitude (optional)" value={form.shopLng} onChange={e=>setForm({...form,shopLng:e.target.value})}/></div><textarea placeholder="Describe your shop and products" value={form.description} onChange={e=>setForm({...form,description:e.target.value})}/><button className="primary" onClick={submit} disabled={busy}>{busy?'Submitting...':application?'Update shop details':'Submit shop for approval'}</button>{application&&<p className="hubMessage">Application status: <b>{application.status}</b></p>}{message&&<p className="hubMessage">{message}</p>}</div>{application?.status==='approved'&&<><div className="card agrovetShopDashboard"><div className="agrovetDashboardHeading"><div><span className="pill">APPROVED SELLER</span><h2>My Shop Dashboard</h2><p>Welcome, {application.shopName}. Add products, upload photos and track marketplace reviews.</p></div><div className="agrovetShopStats"><b>{products.length}</b><small>Total listings</small><b>{products.filter(p=>p.status==='approved'&&p.available!==false).length}</b><small>Published</small><b>{products.filter(p=>p.status==='pending').length}</b><small>Awaiting review</small></div></div></div><div className="card"><h2><Plus size={20}/> Add a marketplace product</h2><p>Upload a clear product photo. Your listing will be reviewed by ShambaVet administrators before publication.</p><div className="formGrid"><input placeholder="Product name *" value={product.name} onChange={e=>setProduct({...product,name:e.target.value})}/><select value={product.category} onChange={e=>setProduct({...product,category:e.target.value})}>{['Veterinary medicines','Animal feeds','Seeds','Fertilizers','Farm equipment'].map(x=><option key={x}>{x}</option>)}</select><input type="number" min="0" placeholder="Price in KSh" value={product.price} onChange={e=>setProduct({...product,price:e.target.value})}/><input placeholder="Unit (e.g. 1 kg, bag, bottle)" value={product.unit} onChange={e=>setProduct({...product,unit:e.target.value})}/></div><label className="agrovetImageUpload"><CloudUpload size={22}/><span><b>{imageBusy?'Uploading image...':'Upload product photo'}</b><small>JPG, PNG or WEBP • Maximum 8 MB • Stored securely in Cloudinary</small></span><input type="file" accept="image/png,image/jpeg,image/webp,image/gif" disabled={imageBusy||busy} onChange={e=>{const file=e.target.files?.[0];if(file)uploadProductImage(file);e.target.value='';}}/></label>{product.imageUrl&&<div className="agrovetImagePreview"><img src={product.imageUrl} alt="Product upload preview"/><div><b>Product photo ready</b><small>Uploaded to Cloudinary</small><button type="button" onClick={()=>setProduct(p=>({...p,imageUrl:''}))}>Remove photo</button></div></div>}<textarea placeholder="Product description, size, usage and storage information" value={product.description} onChange={e=>setProduct({...product,description:e.target.value})}/><button className="primary" onClick={addProduct} disabled={busy||imageBusy||!product.name.trim()}><Plus/> Submit product for review</button>{message&&<p className="hubMessage" role="status" aria-live="polite">{message}</p>}</div><div className="card"><div className="adminHead"><div><h2>My product listings</h2><p>Track approval status and remove products you no longer sell.</p></div></div>{products.length?products.map(p=><div className="row agrovetProductRow" key={p.id}>{p.imageUrl?<img src={p.imageUrl} alt={p.name} style={{width:64,height:64,objectFit:'cover',borderRadius:10}}/>:<span className="big">🛒</span>}<div><b>{p.name}</b><small>{p.category} • {p.price==null?'Price on request':'KSh '+p.price} {p.unit?'• '+p.unit:''}</small><small>{p.description||'No description provided.'}</small></div><span className="status">{p.status==='approved'&&p.available!==false?'Published':p.status==='pending'?'Pending review':p.status||'Unpublished'}</span><button className="danger" onClick={()=>remove(p)}>Remove</button></div>):<Empty text="You have not submitted products yet. Add your first listing above."/>}</div></>}</>;
